he storm on Arcadia featured; scenes shown of damaged buildings, including the reporter inside a ruined restaurant.  [Resident Frank HUNT, DeSoto County sheriff's department Sgt. Jim VITALI&#134;, Charlotte County emergency management Wayne SALLADE&#134;, FIU International Hurricane Research Center Hugh WILLOUGHBY&#134;- comment on the weather forecast & what really happened.]  [WOMAN, BUSH&nbsp- talk about \"hurricane amnesia.\"] \n (Studio: Kate Snow)  Report introduced. \n (Washington: Geoff Morrell)  The reaction of campaigning presidential candidates President Bush & Senator John Kerry to Hurricane Charley featured; scenes shown of storm damages from Charley & Andrew {1992}.  [BUSH&nbsp- says the federal government is responding.] \n (Studio: Kate Snow)  Weather maps shown of the route of now-Tropical Storm Charley & of new Tropical Storms, Danielle & Earl.", "segment_duration": 540, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63060.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762303, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "IriKdBmXqn", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-14", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1700, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762302, "segment_id": "2hni5iJOeh", "segment_broadcast_id": "IriKdBmXqn", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Kate Snow)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63600.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762304, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "IriKdBmXq